    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0016",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "Ik ga een webshop maken voor brillen. Het is vooral gewoon een website waar mensen dingen kunnen kopen. De",
      "token_estimate": 26,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0017",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "site moet mooi zijn en werken. Ik heb niet echt onderzocht waarom dit nodig is, maar ik denk dat mensen brillen",
      "token_estimate": 27,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0018",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "leuk vinden.",
      "token_estimate": 3,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0019",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "De doelgroep is iedereen. Eigenlijk vooral jonge mensen, maar ook oude mensen en slechtzienden en",
      "token_estimate": 24,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0020",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "investeerders en mensen die goedkoop willen kopen. Dit is heel breed maar dat maakt niet uit.",
      "token_estimate": 23,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0021",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "De webshop wordt paars, zwart, wit, groen en misschien geel. De taal wordt Nederlands of",
      "token_estimate": 22,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0022",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "Engels of allebei, dat beslis ik later. De beperking is dat er weinig producten zijn omdat dat",
      "token_estimate": 23,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0023",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "sneller is.",
      "token_estimate": 2,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0024",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "caption",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie"
      ],
      "text": "Figuur 1: ontwerp komt later. Ik had geen tijd om Figma toe te voegen.",
      "token_estimate": 17,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0025",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse"
      ],
      "text": "H2 Stakeholders analyse",
      "token_estimate": 5,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0026",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse"
      ],
      "text": "De stakeholders zijn gewoon de belangrijkste mensen. Ik heb er niet veel gekozen omdat dat overzichtelijker is.",
      "token_estimate": 27,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0027",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse"
      ],
      "text": "Categorisatie: primair/secundair heb ik niet helemaal gedaan. Klant is primair, developer ook, investeerder",
      "token_estimate": 26,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0028",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse"
      ],
      "text": "misschien. Verder zijn er geen echte concerns uitgewerkt.",
      "token_estimate": 14,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0029",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse"
      ],
      "text": "Belangen en concerns: iedereen wil dat de website goed is. Dat is het eigenlijk. Er is geen interview gedaan of",
      "token_estimate": 27,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0030",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse"
      ],
      "text": "deskresearch gebruikt.",
      "token_estimate": 5,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0031",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse"
      ],
      "text": "Stakeholder matrix: niet gemaakt. Ik denk dat de investeerder ergens rechtsboven staat.",
      "token_estimate": 21,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0032",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse",
        "H3 Onderzoek naar web gebruikers"
      ],
      "text": "H3 Onderzoek naar web gebruikers",
      "token_estimate": 8,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0033",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse",
        "H3 Onderzoek naar web gebruikers"
      ],
      "text": "Ik heb geen echt onderzoek gedaan naar webgebruikers. Ik heb zelf bedacht dat studenten vaak online shoppen.",
      "token_estimate": 27,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0034",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse",
        "H3 Onderzoek naar web gebruikers"
      ],
      "text": "Slechtziende mensen hebben grote letters nodig. Verder heb ik geen bronnen gebruikt.",
      "token_estimate": 21,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "23276484",
      "block_id": "23276484_0035",
      "page_no": 3,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "H1 Introductie",
        "H2 Stakeholders analyse",
        "H3 Onderzoek naar web gebruikers"
      ],
      "text": "Persona: Emma, 19 jaar. Ze houdt van brillen en TikTok. Ze wil goedkope brillen. Ze gebruikt mobiel. Dit profiel is",
      "token_estimate": 28,
      "is_front_matter": false,
      "is_appendix": false,
      "table_meta": null
    },
    {
